@title: HTML5 and pointer drag inside a same-origin iframe
STEP 1: A refused drop leaves the card where it was
    NAVIGATE to @SITE@/dndframe.html
    DRAG 'Write report' and drop it into 'Locked'
    VERIFY that 'drag ended without drop' is present
STEP 2: An accepted drop moves it
    DRAG 'Write report' and drop it into 'Done'
    VERIFY that 'moved card1 to done' is present
STEP 3: A pointer-based drag still uses the pointer
    DRAG 'Slider knob' and drop it into 'Pointer target'
    VERIFY that 'pointer drop ok' is present
DONE.
